menu "Dump-IO Drivers"
	depends on AW_BSP

config AW_DDRECC
	tristate "Dump-IO Support for Allwinner SoCs"
	depends on AW_BSP
	default y
	help
	  Say y here if you want to support sunxi dump-io module.
	  The dump-io module is used to dump registers of any device.
	  When in doubt, say "Y".

endmenu
